msgstr "2 秒"

msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "玩法说明"

msgid "Got It"
msgstr "明白了"

msgid "Room %s   /   %s"
msgstr "关卡 %s   /   %s"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Hint"
msgstr "提示"

msgid "Cancel Edit"
msgstr "取消修改"

msgid "Edit Last Echo"
msgstr "修改最后一段回声"

msgid "Restart Room"
msgstr "重开本关"

msgid "Choose Room"
msgstr "选择关卡"

msgid "Room Complete"
msgstr "关卡完成"

msgid "%s Complete"
msgstr "%s · 完成"

msgid "Next Room"
msgstr "下一关"

msgid "Next Chapter"
msgstr "下一章"

msgid "Beats  %d    ·    Echoes  %d"
msgstr "拍数  %d    ·    回声  %d"

msgid "Move one tile per beat. Press Enter to leave an echo. Z undoes a beat. R restarts the room and clears all echoes."
msgstr "每走一格，时间前进一拍。按 Enter 留下回声，按 Z 撤销一拍，按 R 重开本关并清空所有回声。"

msgid "L is a lens. Two selves on its tile open the L gate for the next move. Two echoes count, even when you are elsewhere."
msgstr "L 是透镜。两个自己同时站在上面，下一步就能通过 L 门。即使你在别处，两个回声也能开启它。"

msgid "Cross an arrow in its marked direction. It reverses after the crossing."
msgstr "沿箭头标记的方向穿过门。通过后，箭头会反向。"

msgid "Step onto a diamond to swap the raised and folded bridges. If the bridge beneath you folds, you can step off it."
msgstr "踩上菱形开关，两组桥交替展开、收起。脚下的桥收起时，你仍然可以走出去。"

msgid "Echoes follow their recorded routes and still trigger devices. If two actors trigger the same device on one beat, it changes once."
msgstr "回声始终沿录制路线行动，并触发机关。同一拍有两人触发同一个机关，它只变化一次。"

msgid "Move one tile with the arrow keys, WASD, or a click on an adjacent tile. Each move advances one beat.\n\nPress Enter to leave an echo and return to the start. It retraces your steps, then fades on the beat after its last move.\n\nA plate opens its matching gate. Cross while the gate is open. Guide the solid dot into the outlined square to finish.\n\nZ undoes a step. R restarts the room and clears all echoes."
msgstr "用方向键、WASD，或点击相邻格来移动。每走一格，时间前进一拍。\n\n按 Enter 留下回声，并回到起点。回声会重走你的路线，在最后一步的下一拍消散。\n\n压板会开启对应的门，趁门开着时通过。让实心圆点走进方框出口，即可完成关卡。\n\n按 Z 撤销一步，按 R 重开本关并清空所有回声。"

msgid "First Trace"
msgstr "初迹"

msgid "Walk to A and press Enter to leave an echo. Then take the path to the exit."
msgstr "走到 A，按 Enter 留下回声。然后沿另一条路走向出口。"

msgid "Your echo retraces one step each time you move."
msgstr "你每走一步，回声也会沿着过去的路线走一步。"

msgid "Step onto A and leave an echo. Take the other path in the next round."
msgstr "站上 A 后留下回声，下一轮沿另一条路前进。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑, then leave the echo. Reach the exit with → → → →."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑，然后留下回声。再用 → → → → 到达出口。"

msgid "Scenic Route"
msgstr "迂回"

msgid "Your echo fades after its last move. Time its arrival at A to match yours at the gate."
msgstr "回声走完路线后会消散。让它到达 A 的时刻，与你到达门前的时刻一致。"

msgid "The short path reaches A in two moves. The gate is four moves from the start."
msgstr "最短路线只需两步就能到 A，但你需要四步才能到门前。"

msgid "Take the upper loop to reach A two beats later."
msgstr "沿上方绕行一圈，让回声晚两拍到达 A。"

msgid "Record ↑ → ↑ ←. Leave the echo, then take five steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ → ↑ ←，留下回声，再向右走五步。"

msgid "Refrain"
msgstr "复奏"

msgid "Both gates open when someone steps on A. Your echo can visit A twice."
msgstr "有人踩住 A 时，两扇门都会打开。你的回声可以两次经过 A。"

msgid "The gates close as soon as A is empty."
msgstr "A 上一旦无人，门就会关闭。"

msgid "After opening the first gate, have your echo step off A and back onto it."
msgstr "打开第一扇门后，让回声离开 A，再走回 A。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑. Leave the echo, then take five steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑，留下回声，再向右走五步。"

msgid "Relay Line"
msgstr "接力"

msgid "One echo can open both gates. Send it past A on the way to B."
msgstr "一个回声也能打开两扇门。让它先经过 A，再走向 B。"

msgid "Select a distant plate to see its gate. A opens the first gate and B opens the second."
msgstr "点击远处的压板可查看对应的门。A 开启第一扇，B 开启第二扇。"

msgid "The upper passage connects A to B."
msgstr "上方的通道连着 A 和 B。"

msgid "Record ↑ ↑ → → → →. Leave the echo, then take seven steps right."
msgstr "录制 ↑ ↑ → → → →，留下回声，再向右走七步。"

msgid "Two Voices"
msgstr "双声"

msgid "Use two echoes to reach A and B on the same beat."
msgstr "让两个回声在同一拍分别到达 A 和 B。"

msgid "One echo must be on A and one on B, with you at the gate."
msgstr "一个回声站在 A，一个站在 B，而你要站在门前。"

msgid "Both echoes reach their plates on beat four. Find a four-step path to the gate."
msgstr "两个回声都在第四拍到达压板。你也需要一条四步到达门前的路线。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑     Exit  ← ↑ ↑ → ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑     出口  ← ↑ ↑ → ↑"

msgid "Interlace"
msgstr "交织"

msgid "Let the first echo open a path for the second. Then use both to reach the exit."
msgstr "让第一个回声为第二个开路，再借助两者走向出口。"

msgid "A opens the passage to B. The exit gate needs both B and C."
msgstr "A 开启通往 B 的路。出口的门需要同时踩住 B 和 C。"

msgid "Send the first echo through A to C. The second can then pass the gate and reach B."
msgstr "让第一个回声经过 A 到达 C，第二个就能穿过门，到达 B。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     Exit  ← ↑ → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑     出口  ← ↑ → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Turnabout"
msgstr "回转"

msgid "Cross the arrow once to turn it around."
msgstr "穿过箭头门一次，它就会反向。"

msgid "The lower path needs A first and B second. The upper path reaches B first."
msgstr "下方路线需要先踩 A，再踩 B，但上方路线先经过 B。"

msgid "Record a trip past B to A, then come back through the reversed arrow."
msgstr "录下经过 B 到达 A 的路线，再穿过已经反向的门返回。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑ → → → ← ←     Exit  eight steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑ → → → ← ←     出口  向右八步。"

msgid "Tidal Shift"
msgstr "潮汐"

msgid "Step on the diamond to swap the two bridges. The change lasts until the next visit."
msgstr "踩上菱形开关，两组桥就会交换状态，直到下次踩中开关。"

msgid "Your first crossing needs the folded bridge. Your second crossing needs the other bank."
msgstr "第一次过桥需要展开当前收起的桥，第二次需要另一组桥。"

msgid "Return to the diamond as your other self reaches the stone between the bridges."
msgstr "当另一个自己走到两座桥之间的石台时，让回声再次踩中菱形。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     Exit  six steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     出口  向右六步。"

msgid "Crosscurrent"
msgstr "错流"

msgid "Two routes share one turnstile. A recorded echo always follows its original path."
msgstr "两条路线共用一扇转向门。录下的回声始终沿原来的路线行动。"

msgid "The lower lane takes two beats longer to reach the arrow. Give that lane to the echo."
msgstr "下方路线到达箭头门需要多走两拍，把这条路留给回声。"

msgid "Cross, step back, then cross again. When both of you land on the diamond together, it switches only once."
msgstr "穿过门，退一步，再次穿过。你和回声同拍踏上菱形时，开关只切换一次。"

msgid "Echo  ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  → → ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↑ ↑."
msgstr "回声  ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  → → ↑ ↓ ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↑ ↑"

msgid "Counterpoint"
msgstr "对位"

msgid "One echo opens the bridge. The next swaps it back. Both must finish at the exit plates."
msgstr "一个回声展开桥，另一个再把它切换回来。最后，两者都要到达出口所需的压板。"

msgid "The left diamond opens both folded bridges. A lets the second echo reach the right diamond."
msgstr "左侧菱形会展开两座收起的桥。A 让第二个回声到达右侧菱形。"

msgid "Send echo one through the arrow, back to A, then to C. Send echo two over the right bridge and through the A gate to B."
msgstr "第一个回声穿过箭头门，返回 A，再去 C。第二个穿过右侧桥和 A 门，走到 B。"

msgid "Echo 1  ←←←↑↑↑↓→←↓↓←     Echo 2  →→→→↑↑↑↑↑←←↓     Exit  ←←←↑↑→→→↑↑↑←↑."
msgstr "回声 1  ←←←↑↑↑↓→←↓↓←     回声 2  →→→→↑↑↑↑↑←←↓     出口  ←←←↑↑→→→↑↑↑←↑"

msgid "First Contact"
msgstr "初遇"

msgid "Find L, the lens. Two selves on its tile open the marked gate."
msgstr "找到透镜 L。两个自己同时站在上面，就能开启标有 L 的门。"

msgid "The two arms take the same number of steps."
msgstr "两侧的支路需要相同的步数。"

msgid "End one recording on L. Come up the other arm and meet it there."
msgstr "让一段录制停在 L，然后从另一侧走来，与它在此相遇。"

msgid "Echo  ← ↑ ↑ →     Exit  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声  ← ↑ ↑ →     出口  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑"

msgid "Borrowed Light"
msgstr "借光"

msgid "After you meet at L, the two bridges need opposite banks on consecutive beats."
msgstr "在 L 相遇后，接连两拍需要不同组的桥展开。"

msgid "The bridge touching L must be raised as you leave the lens."
msgstr "离开透镜时，紧挨着 L 的桥必须展开。"

msgid "Let your echo take one more step after the meeting. While you step onto the first bridge, it can reach the switch."
msgstr "相遇后让回声再走一步。你踏上第一座桥时，它就能踩中开关。"

msgid "Echo  → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声  → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  → ↑ ↑ ← ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Confluence"
msgstr "合流"

msgid "The first gate needs two different places. The last needs the same place twice."
msgstr "第一扇门需要两人分处两地，最后一扇需要两人同处一格。"

msgid "At the elbow in the lower passage, look at where both echoes must be."
msgstr "走到下方通道的拐角时，想想两个回声分别应该在哪里。"

msgid "Send an echo to each plate. After that beat, have both paths turn inward to the lens."
msgstr "让两个回声各去一块压板，随后都向内转弯，走向透镜。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓"

msgid "Totality"
msgstr "全食"

msgid "A recorded crossing survives even when the bridge beneath it folds."
msgstr "即使桥已经收起，录下的回声仍能沿原来的路线穿过。"

msgid "Record on the original bank. Both echoes must reach L, then return to their separate plates."
msgstr "在桥的初始状态下录制。两个回声都要到达 L，再各自回到压板。"

msgid "In the last round, flip the bank on your way to the lens gate. Your echoes can cross the folded bridges on the way back."
msgstr "最后一轮，在走向 L 门的途中切换桥。回声返回时，依然能穿过收起的桥。"

msgid "Echo 1  ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↓ ↓ ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  ↓ ↓ ← ← ← ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ → →     Exit  → → ↓ ↓ ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↑ → →"
msgstr "回声 1  ↑ ↑ ← ← ← ↓ ↓ ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  ↓ ↓ ← ← ← ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ → →     出口  → → ↓ ↓ ↓ → → ↑ ↑ ↑ → →"

msgid "Nocturne"
msgstr "夜曲"

msgid "Hush"
msgstr "静息"

msgid "Negative Space"
msgstr "留空"

msgid "Coda"
msgstr "尾声"

msgid "Gate needs empty %s"
msgstr "需要让 %s 上空无一人。"

msgid "A gate marked −A needs A empty before you move. −L needs an empty lens; even one echo keeps it shut. A fading echo can open the way."
msgstr "标有 −A 的门，需要在移动前让 A 空置。−L 需要透镜上空无一人，留下一个回声也无法通过。回声消散后，路才会打开。"

msgid "A opens one gate. An empty A opens the next. Let your echo finish its part."
msgstr "A 开启第一扇门，空置的 A 开启下一扇。让回声完成它的任务。"

msgid "A minus sign marks an empty-plate gate. It checks the board before your move."
msgstr "减号表示空置门。它会在你移动之前，检查对应压板是否空着。"

msgid "End the recording on A. The echo opens the first gate, then fades before you reach the second."
msgstr "让录制停在 A。回声开启第一扇门，在你到达第二扇门前消散。"

msgid "Echo  ↑ ↑     Exit  five steps right."
msgstr "回声  ↑ ↑     出口  向右五步。"

msgid "Together at first. Then only B. Give one echo a shorter ending."
msgstr "先同时踩住两处，再只留下 B。让一个回声更早结束。"

msgid "The first gate needs both plates. The last needs B occupied and A empty."
msgstr "第一扇门需要同时踩住两块压板。最后一扇需要 B 有人、A 空置。"

msgid "Let the A recording end on beat four. Have the B recording leave its plate and return on beat six."
msgstr "让 A 的录制在第四拍结束。B 的录制离开压板一步，再在第六拍返回。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     Exit  ← → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ↓ ↑     出口  ← → ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑ ↑"

msgid "Separate, meet, disappear. Three gates need three different moments."
msgstr "分开，相遇，消散。三扇门，需要三个不同的时刻。"

msgid "The first gate needs A and B. The second needs two selves on L. The final gate needs L completely empty."
msgstr "第一扇门需要 A 和 B，第二扇需要两个自己在 L 相遇，最后一扇需要 L 完全空置。"

msgid "Let both recordings end together on L. Cross the L gate on their last beat; after they fade, the last gate opens."
msgstr "让两段录制同时在 L 结束。在它们的最后一拍穿过 L 门，消散后再通过最后一扇门。"

msgid "Echo 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     Echo 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     Exit  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓ ↓ ↓"
msgstr "回声 1  ← ← ↑ ↑ → →     回声 2  → → ↑ ↑ ← ←     出口  ↓ ↓ → → → ↓ ↓ ↓ ↓"

msgid "Move up"
msgstr "向上移动"

msgid "Move down"
msgstr "向下移动"

msgid "Move left"
msgstr "向左移动"

msgid "Move right"
msgstr "向右移动"

msgid "Echo"
msgstr "回声"

msgid "Tap a direction to move one tile per beat. Tap Leave an Echo to record your route. Undo takes back a beat; Pause offers hints and Restart Room."
msgstr "点方向盘，每步移动一格。点“留下回声”记录路线；“撤销”退回一步，暂停菜单中可以查看提示或重开关卡。"

msgid "Tap a direction on the pad, or an adjacent tile, to move one step. Each move advances one beat.\n\nTap Leave an Echo to record your route and return to the start. Your echo retraces your steps, then fades after its last move.\n\nA plate opens its matching gate. Guide the solid dot into the outlined square to finish.\n\nUndo takes back a step. Open Pause for hints or Restart Room."
msgstr "点方向盘或相邻格子，每次移动一步。世界只在你移动时前进一步。\n\n点“留下回声”记录路线并回到起点。回声会重走这条路线，并在最后一步之后消散。\n\n踏板可以开启对应的门。让实心棋子走到空心方框中即可过关。\n\n“撤销”退回一步。暂停菜单中可以查看提示或重开关卡。"

msgid "Extra"
msgstr "额外挑战"

msgid "Escapement"
msgstr "擒纵"

msgid "The bridges read like a score. Decide what the switch must do before you leave the lens."
msgstr "沿出口方向看三座桥。离开透镜之前，开关应该处在哪个状态？"

msgid "Read the three decks from L to the exit. The first and third rise together; the middle one needs the opposite bank."
msgstr "从 L 往出口数，第一座桥和第三座桥同时升起，中间那座恰好相反。"

msgid "Send the recording to the switch before the meeting. After you meet, it must tap the switch twice more and finish on A."
msgstr "让回声先踩一次开关，再回来和你会合。分开以后，它还要踩两次开关，最后抵达 A。"

msgid "1: ↑2 ←2 →2 ←2 → ← ↑2   /   Exit: ↑2 ←2 →4 ↑2 →2 ↓"
msgstr "1: ↑2 ←2 →2 ←2 → ← ↑2   /   出口： ↑2 ←2 →4 ↑2 →2 ↓"

msgid "Understudy"
msgstr "替身"

msgid "Someone must reach B in a recording. Start by working out who could let them through the lens gate."
msgstr "得有人在录制时抵达 B。先想想，谁能替它打开透镜门？"

msgid "During the second recording, meet the first echo on L. As you enter the raised deck, that echo can change the bank for the next step."
msgstr "录第二段时，和第一段回声在 L 上会合。你踏上第一座桥的同时，让它切换桥面，接上下一步。"

msgid "The exit passage needs two visits to the switch, then quiet. Let the first echo end on A while the second is still able to return to B."
msgstr "出口这一路需要切换两次桥面。让第一段回声停录在 A，给第二段留出再次回到 B 的时间。"

msgid "1: ↑2 ←2 → ←   /   2: ↑4 →2 ← →   /   Exit: →4 ↑5"
msgstr "1: ↑2 ←2 → ←   /   2: ↑4 →2 ← →   /   出口： →4 ↑5"

msgid "Triptych"
msgstr "三联画"

msgid "Three recordings share the last crossing. Look for the room that can only be recorded after two others exist."
msgstr "第三段回声要去哪里？找找那条必须先有两段录制才能走进的侧廊。"

msgid "Trace both outside paths from their plates to L and back. Record those return trips while the upper bridges are raised."
msgstr "从两块踏板沿外侧走到 L，再原路折返。趁上方的桥还升着，把两个来回都录下来。"

msgid "The third echo must visit C twice. Between visits, send it back to the vault switch to raise the final bridge while the other two return to their plates."
msgstr "第三段回声要两次抵达 C。中途折返回侧廊的开关，让最后一座桥升起来。此时，前两段回声也该踏上各自的踏板了。"

msgid "1: ←3 ↑2 →3 ←3 ↓2   /   2: →3 ↑2 ←3 →3 ↓2   /   3: ↓2 ←2 ↓2 ← ↓ ↑ → ↑ ↓ ← ↓   /   Exit: ↓2 →2 ↓2 →3 ↑5 →"
msgstr "1: ←3 ↑2 →3 ←3 ↓2   /   2: →3 ↑2 ←3 →3 ↓2   /   3: ↓2 ←2 ↓2 ← ↓ ↑ → ↑ ↓ ← ↓   /   出口： ↓2 →2 ↓2 →3 ↑5 →"

msgid "Switchyard"
msgstr "道岔"

msgid "Look around the exit square. Each of its three doors listens to a different pair of plates."
msgstr "先绕着终点看一圈。三面各有一扇门，听的是三种不同的踏板组合。"

msgid "A and C open the north door. The other two doors need B, down the shaft below the lens. Who will be with you when you record that crossing?"
msgstr "北门听 A 和 C，另两扇门都要用到透镜下方的 B。录下穿过透镜门的那一步时，谁会和你一起站在 L 上？"

msgid "For the west door, let both recordings meet on L. One goes down the shaft, the other returns to A. On your last trip, leave the west deck raised."
msgstr "可以试试西门。让两段录制在 L 会合，一段下井，另一段回到 A。最后一趟，给自己留一座升起的西桥。"

msgid "West door   /   1: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ←4 ↓   /   2: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ↓3 ↑ ↓   /   Exit: ↓4 ←2 ↑2 ←6 ↓2 ↑2 →2 ↑2 →2"
msgstr "西门   /   1: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ←4 ↓   /   2: ↑2 ←8 ↓4 →4 ↓3 ↑ ↓   /   出口： ↓4 ←2 ↑2 ←6 ↓2 ↑2 →2 ↑2 →2"
